{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:40.110Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pwr-line **Syscap:** pwrlink **Type:** Directory":"## interface/pwr-line \n**Syscap：** pwrlink\n**Type：** Directory","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pwr-line/reset-mac-address **Syscap:** pwrlink **Type:** Command":"## interface/pwr-line/reset-mac-address \n**Syscap：** pwrlink\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pwr-line/upgrade-firmware **Syscap:** pwrlink **Type:** Command":"## interface/pwr-line/upgrade-firmware \n**Syscap：** pwrlink\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## interface/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/sstp-client **Type:** Directory":"## interface/sstp-client \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/sstp-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/sstp-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/sstp-server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/sstp-server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/sstp-server/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/sstp-server/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/sstp-server/server **Type:** Settings Directory":"## interface/sstp-server/server \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/veth **Conditions:** !smips **Syscap:** container **Type:** Directory":"## interface/veth \n**条件：** !smips\n**系统能力：** container\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000Virtual Ethernet interfaces that connect containers to RouterOS. One end of a veth is this RouterOS interface; the other end is the network interface of the container that uses it, with the veth's name and `container-mac-address`. The address, gateway and DHCP settings are applied inside the container. A veth runs only while a container that uses it runs. See [VETH](LINK).":"用于将容器连接到 RouterOS 的虚拟以太网接口。veth 的一端是此 RouterOS 接口；另一端是使用它的容器的网络接口，具有 veth 名称和 `container-mac-address`。地址、网关和 DHCP 设置在容器内部应用。veth 仅在使用它的容器运行时运行。请参阅 [VETH](/docs/7.25/containers/veth)。"}}
